'''Vs Retsu Kaioh''' (VS烈海王, ''VS Retsu Kaiō'', '''VS Kaiou Retsu''') is a [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Hanma Baki: Son of Ogre]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.3 Update]]. The boss of this [[Gauntlet]] is [[Retsu Kaioh (Enemy)|Retsu Kaioh]].

==Overview==
===About===
Vs Retsu Kaioh contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''I Don't Mind One Bit Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of an I Don't Mind One Bit Lv. can include XP, [[Battle Items]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]] and Legend Dumbbells. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Vs Retsu Kaioh/I Don't Mind One Bit Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*VS Retsu Kaioh is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

